{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_024_23_5_02_024_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:10f92519998fb3269dd0d3ed58374354d7fc8cfbf4ff4dfc1e8a78683898408c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_23_5_02_024_23:5_02_024_23:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe15b87c82ac070070abe7a1b90889ad6a45775ab56fc8ed095dd5057d787b15",
      "text": "啊，找到啦！●●●●プロデューサー酱，\n现在能耽误你一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_23_5_02_024_23:5_02_024_23:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e257f9910c151798772e5c589bc33b1052d0b00e2c7f1c0086765189eadf5de3",
      "text": "这个，是白色情人节的回礼！\n请收下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_23_5_02_024_23:5_02_024_23:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e949847eeebb5ba98b988b7fbc9486860343ae46d494c04a1fc9262c0b2b564",
      "text": "非常感谢，四季先生！好漂亮的\n留言卡……上面好像附带了什么二维码呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_23_5_02_024_23:5_02_024_23:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e9350a666b335b337973254e3d630b535f9a2976f3631a384005d81d278f504",
      "text": "亏你能发现！\n只要扫描那个码……居然！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_23_5_02_024_23:5_02_024_23:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d05a7c99ef997da015a6c6bc1259a90368779bbc4e20b1ebcbb849ffd51d957",
      "text": "就会跳转到我亲手制作的超炸裂最强歌单哦！\n当然，High×Joker的歌曲也收录在里面啦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_23_5_02_024_23:5_02_024_23:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33801f018b2c334b64b0f78deb8ee3942e28384bd00c1c082cea5225072387f7",
      "text": "这可是经过千挑万选出来的自信之作哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_23_5_02_024_23:5_02_024_23:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e8718c3ab3ccbe883fb66a6dba0843dd82578adaa26bb1920bfe74ffb2535cf",
      "text": "可以安安静静地细品……还有，\n在工作的时候拿来当BGM也很棒哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_23_5_02_024_23:5_02_024_23:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5250000b594bda20260720eae8c9d6b160a67ab5a154e66f262a9883dcf25221",
      "text": "四季先生制作的最强歌单吗。\n这可真让人期待呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_23_5_02_024_23:5_02_024_23:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd54959ad3e579ca4fbb416fe8317742c6ebe7f77c4af5f100fe8b8018167085",
      "text": "顺便说一下，里面的歌我全都记住了，\n无论哪一首我都能完美唱出来哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_024_23_5_02_024_23:5_02_024_23:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e364d90f377a67a831115c994bcab0fc5c020547f9387da74518cfed02a7c2",
      "text": "要是哪天想听我唱歌了随时跟我说！\n我会帅气十足地唱给你听的☆",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
